   "body": {
    "en": "A wave and its reflection travelling in opposite directions make a standing wave, with nodes (zero displacement) and antinodes (maximum), each λ/2 apart; a node and the next antinode are λ/4 apart. A string fixed at both ends has nodes at both ends: ν = n v/(2L), n = 1, 2, 3… A pipe closed at one end has a node at the closed end and an antinode at the open end: ν = (2n − 1) v/(4L), odd harmonics only. A pipe open at both ends: ν = n v/(2L), all harmonics.",
    "kn": "ವಿರುದ್ಧ ದಿಕ್ಕಿನ ಎರಡು ತರಂಗಗಳು ನಿಂತ ತರಂಗ ಉಂಟುಮಾಡುತ್ತವೆ: ನಿಸ್ಪಂದ ಮತ್ತು ಪ್ರಸ್ಪಂದ ಬಿಂದುಗಳು λ/2 ಅಂತರದಲ್ಲಿ. ಎರಡೂ ತುದಿ ಬಿಗಿದ ತಂತಿ ಮತ್ತು ತೆರೆದ ಕೊಳವೆ: ν = nv/(2L). ಒಂದು ತುದಿ ಮುಚ್ಚಿದ ಕೊಳವೆ: ಬೆಸ ಸಂನಾದಿಗಳು ಮಾತ್ರ, ν = (2n − 1)v/(4L)."
   },
   "points": [
